# Fine-Tuning LLMs for Lecture Summarization — 4-Day Plan

## Goal

Improve the accuracy of CS and Math lecture summaries by fine-tuning specialized LLMs:
- **DeepSeek-Math-7B-Instruct** → Math lectures (equations, proofs, distributions)
- **CodeLlama-7B-Instruct** → CS lectures (code, algorithms, data structures)

The fine-tuned LoRA adapters will be integrated into `pipeline.py` via a subject-aware router.

